<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; font-size:12pt; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;">
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>A Grid Amendment requires your approval.</p>
<p><strong>Grid:</strong> {!Grid__c.Name}</p>
